WEBVTT

00:00:28.892 --> 00:00:30.561
and a princess the next year,

00:00:30.561 --> 00:00:33.564
and another princess the following year,
but you know, Disney.

00:00:33.597 --> 00:00:34.598
(Laughter)

00:00:34.631 --> 00:00:37.601
The point is, I was clearly a girl,

00:00:37.634 --> 00:00:41.638
but the one thing that I couldn't
beg my parents into getting for me

00:00:41.672 --> 00:00:43.040
was actual girlhood.

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:46.843
Now if you haven't figured it out
already, I am transgender,

00:00:46.877 --> 00:00:49.846
but don't worry, I'm not here
to raid your bathrooms

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:51.048
and take your women.

00:00:51.081 --> 00:00:52.616
(Laughter)

00:00:52.649 --> 00:00:55.619
I am here to tell you
what it's like to be trans,

00:00:55.652 --> 00:00:59.590
what it's like to struggle every day
with acceptance from yourself

00:00:59.623 --> 00:01:01.191
and those around you.